  Hi,

what a pity, I just thought I found a major spoiler with which I could
level teleport even WITH the amulet of Yendor.  But the Dev Team has
obviously done a good job.  Anyway, I think it may interest you:

You cannot level teleport with the amulet because the amulet itself prevents
you from level teleporting (it even makes normal teleport sometimes
impossible). The message you get is "you feel momentarily disoriented".
So I thought you could have a pet on the leash and, because it comes with
you if you teleport, you could let the pet take the amulet and in this very
moment do a level teleport.  Of course, the pet must have "hands" (the
ability to take something) and the amulet must be blessed, so the chance
that the pet takes it is high --- some tripe may help.

But (and I found this in wizard mode): Though the pet takes the amulet and
you can then level teleport, there appears a message "your pet feels
momentarily disoriented." and "the leash snaps loose" or something like that.
Apparently the pet as the new owner of the amulet has now lost the ability
to level teleport with me...

OK, it was worth a try...

--ralf
